# Not used by this project's builds, and kept only to say so: every build
# context in compose.yaml is a ./config/<service> subdirectory (backrest,
# beszel-agent, piper, parakeet, system-tools), and Docker resolves
# .dockerignore against the context directory, never against the repository
# root. The real exclusions live in config/<service>/.dockerignore.
#
# Nothing here is a substitute for those: no Dockerfile in this repository
# does `COPY .`, so a secret in a context is uploaded to the daemon but never
# lands in an image layer.
